# The agent asks to use the vault's token (e2e/fake: secret:): the card comes to alice's phone in the test chat, saying
# the command; 允许 grants it, and the agent runs the command with it (secret_run), the value hidden from it.
#only android
timeout 120000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer send 密钥测试 {T} secret:e2e-token|echo have:${E2E_SECRET:+yes}
tap 端到端测试
until 使用 e2e-token
shot 1-card
tap 允许
# (the vault's key kept under the screen lock: the system asks for the PIN)
log do: android-unlock 1234
done 2-android-unlock
until 用密钥跑完了
shot 2-ran
